# ==============================================================
# OCEAN PUZZLE - MAP START RESET (4 of 4)
# ==============================================================
# Script type : walk
# Bind to     : [FILL IN: x y z]
# Map/area    : [FILL IN: map name / room]
#
# What it does:
#   Clears the player's Ocean Puzzle progress (answer and
#   solved status), so leaving and re-joining the map
#   restarts the puzzle.
#
# Placement note:
#   Where players arrive when they join the map. NOT at the
#   checkpoint, since returning there should keep progress.
#
# Requires: oceanpuzzle namespace (see Submit script header)
# Related scripts: Submit (1), Entrance (2), Exit (3)
# ==============================================================
@using oceanpuzzle
@var solved = false
@var answer = ""
